00:19:50.655 --> 00:19:52.922
<i>I admit that I'm often...</i>

500
00:19:52.923 --> 00:19:55.725
<i>vexed at the behavior
 of my own people.</i>

501
00:19:55.726 --> 00:19:58.997
<i>Yeah, "vexed" is a good word.</i>

502
00:20:00.799 --> 00:20:04.135
 I told you about messi'’
 with them white women.

503
00:20:06.471 --> 00:20:08.938
<i>HUEY:
 You do what you can to help black folks,</i>

504
00:20:08.939 --> 00:20:11.408
<i>and they make you wonder
 why you even bother.</i>

505
00:20:11.409 --> 00:20:12.743
 [SNORING]

506
00:20:12.744 --> 00:20:14.245
 [SNORTS, GRUMBLES]

507
00:20:14.246 --> 00:20:15.913
<i>But they're our people,</i>

508
00:20:15.914 --> 00:20:18.483
<i>and we gotta love 'em
 regardless.</i>

509
00:20:22.454 --> 00:20:24.254
 [SMOOTH R & B MUSIC
 PLAYING OVER SPEAKER]

510
00:20:24.255 --> 00:20:26.525
 [CROWD CHEERING]

511
00:20:37.202 --> 00:20:38.769
WOMAN:
Break it down!

512
00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:41.071
<i>HUEY:
 One thing for sure, though.</i>

513
00:20:41.072 --> 00:20:43.674
<i>Can't blame this one
 on the white man.</i>

514
00:20:43.675 --> 00:20:45.342
<i>What am I saying?</i>

515
00:20:45.343 --> 00:20:48.011
<i>Of course I can.</i>

516
00:20:48.012 --> 00:20:50.382
 [?]